notes = "(!) Load the bundle.ini of a game from the Atari VCS (2021) store, unpacked.|(!) The games are Linux x86-64 programs: they run directly on x86-64 Linux and through box64 on aarch64 Linux (box64 from ATARIVCS_BOX64 or PATH).|(!) No savestates or rewind: the game runs as its own process."
description = "Plays the native Linux games of the Atari VCS (2021) store in RetroArch. The game runs as its own process with a small library preloaded into it, which hands every frame and its sound to RetroArch and gives it RetroArch's controller as a gamepad, so the games play with any controller or the keyboard."
